             Portuguese, 48px in Spanish, which is precisely the width of the new
             link in each language. It still overflows at 1500px, because the
             container is capped, so no shorter label fixes it either.
             A seventh primary item therefore requires DEMOTING one of Antonio's
             existing six, shortening labels he has already ruled on, or widening
